<title>UK: Lehman prices Corestates Capital $150 million FRN. [CORRECTED 16:58 GMT]</title>
<headline>Lehman prices Corestates Capital $150 million FRN. [CORRECTED 16:58 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue has been priced, lead manager Lehman Brothers said Thursday.  BORROWER   CORESTATES CAPITAL 2</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  CORESTATES BANK NA</p>
<p> AMT	  $150 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    15.JAN.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +65 BP    PAY DATE   *23.JAN.97</p>
<p>(Corrects margin from +80 b.p.)</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  97.988    FULL FEES   0.875</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A-	  REOFFER    97.988</p>
<p> NOTES     *SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
